<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 552.91, up 4.88.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 288 to 252.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.11.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,138,290 compared with 19,939,000 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
